# The humiliation after a surrender (docs/npc-agent.md, mercy), staged without the AI server to judge how it
# looks: the hero kneels (heropose, as player_pose), Lobart stands PEE_DISTANCE_CM in front of him facing him
# and plays the native T_STAND_2_PEE -> S_PEE. Stills from the side, three-quarter front and behind the npc.
cheat god
set time 12 0
goto NW_FARM1_OUT_01
freeze BAU_950_LOBART
overlay off
wait 3000
heropose kneel
wait 2500
put BAU_950_LOBART 100 0
wait 800
ani BAU_950_LOBART T_STAND_2_PEE
wait 5000
watch BAU_950_LOBART
anims
watch player
cam follow 230 95 90
rec stream
wait 2000
stop
cam follow 150 95 75
wait 500
shot stream-close
cam follow 300 90 90
wait 500
shot side-100
cam follow 260 110 50
wait 500
shot q-100
cam follow 260 120 160
wait 500
shot back-100
cam follow 170 80 80
wait 500
shot close-100
wait 600
